.page sudoers 5 who may borrow root's power

# DESCRIPTION
`/Hakurei/etc/sudoers` is read by sudo(1) (also called `eiki`). Each line names one rule; `#` starts a comment:

    name                a user
    name NOPASSWD       the same, without asking for a password
    %group              everyone in a group
    %group NOPASSWD
    ALL                 everybody

A caller who matches no line is refused. One who matches is asked for their own password if they have one, unless the rule says `NOPASSWD`; root is never asked. The shipped file lets `root` and `marisa` in (she borrows everything anyway).

# SEE ALSO
sudo(1), su(1), accounts(7)
